    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">af-frĭo</span></b>  (better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adf-</span></b> ), āre, v.
